# Numista.AI Product Roadmap

## The Vision (In One Sentence)
Numista.AI is the world's definitive research platform and collection manager for US coinage — not an appraisal app, but an *experience* that connects collectors to the human stories embedded in metal.

---

## Priority 1A: Collection Onboarding — The Make-or-Break Problem

> [!IMPORTANT]
> A user with 5,000 coins needs to be **fully onboarded in under 30 minutes**, not 5 hours. This is the single biggest barrier to adoption and must be solved before the desktop platform is meaningfully promoted.

### What the user needs:
- Get what they *already have* into the platform as fast as possible
- With no manual coin-by-coin data entry

### Ingestion Strategies (in order of effort for the user)

#### Tier 1: Zero-Effort Import (Target: <5 min for any size collection)
| Source | Method | Who Uses It |
|---|---|---|
| **PCGS Registry CSV export** | Parse their export format, map to our schema | Serious graded coin collectors |
| **NGC Registry CSV export** | Same as above | Serious graded coin collectors |
| **PCGS CoinFacts** | API or scrape user's registry | ~5M registered collectors |
| **Excel / CSV upload** | Generic: Year, Mint, Denom, Grade, Paid | Spreadsheet-keepers |
| **Other app exports** | CoinManage, Coin Collector, etc. | Casual/intermediate users |

#### Tier 2: Semi-Automated (Target: <2 hours for a full binder)
| Method | Mechanism | Status |
|---|---|---|
| **Checklist scanning** | Gemini Vision + Document AI (littleton-v1) | ✅ Built — needs stabilization |
| **Batch photo identification** | Upload 20–50 coin photos; AI identifies & adds each | 🔨 To Build |
| **Dealer invoice parsing** | Upload a PDF receipt from a coin dealer | 🔨 To Build |

#### Tier 3: Manual Entry (Fallback, for individual coins)
- Fast smart-search: type "1921 Morgan" and it auto-fills all metadata
- No blank forms — every field is pre-populated from the knowledge base

### What to Build First
1. **PCGS/NGC CSV importer** — the fastest win for the target audience
2. **Generic CSV importer** — broader audience
3. **Stabilize the checklist scan pipeline** ← already in progress
4. **Batch photo identification** — high effort but very high wow factor

