## Priority 2: Coin Image Identification

> [!NOTE]
> "Shazam for coins." Point a camera at a coin and get its full Numista.AI record page.

### Pipeline
1. User uploads photo (desktop: drag-and-drop; mobile: camera)
2. Vision Agent (Gemini Vision) identifies: denomination, year, mint mark, die variety if detectable
3. Match to Numista.AI knowledge base record
4. Display full coin record + option to "Add to My Collection"

### What Makes This Different
Most apps stop at "Lincoln Cent, 1969." Numista.AI then opens the full record page — the story, the history, the mintage, the errors to look for on *this specific variety*. The identification is the door; the knowledge base is the room.

