## Priority 4: Phone Companion App (Flutter — Existing Work)

Reframed role: the phone app is **not** the platform. It is the field tool.

| Use Case | Phone App Feature |
|---|---|
| At a coin show | Quick camera ID of a coin you're considering buying |
| At home with a new purchase | Scan to add to collection |
| Checking the collection | Browse, filter, view coin records |
| Checklist scanning | Photograph Littleton-style checklists |

The phone app is a gateway to the desktop platform, not a replacement for it.

