## The Multi-Agent Architecture (Mapped to Priorities)

| Agent | Priority it Serves | What It Does |
|---|---|---|
| **Ingestion Agent** | 1A | Parses CSVs, photos, invoices; populates the collection |
| **Vision Agent** | 2, 3 | Identifies coins from photos; microscope image analysis |
| **Historian Agent** | 1B | Writes and updates coin stories; answers deep research questions |
| **Market Data Tool** | 1B | Fetches eBay/auction results on demand (not a full agent) |
| **Grading Agent** | 3 | Analyzes microscope images; issues grade + coin ID |

